---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
title: "DreamMeaningGuide — Explore Your Symbolic Inner World";
description: "Decode dream symbols, explore Guides, consult The Seer, and build your dream journal archive.";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="content">

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>DreamMeaningGuide</h1>
      <p class="tagline">
        Explore your symbolic inner world — decode dream symbols, consult The Seer, and build your dream archive.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr />

    <!-- INTRO SECTION -->
    <section class="intro">
      <p>
        Your dreams are messages from the deeper layers of your mind.  
        DreamMeaningGuide helps you interpret those messages through symbolism, reflection, and guided insight.
      </p>
      <p>
        Begin your journey by exploring dream symbols, reading Guides, consulting The Seer,  
        or recording your dreams in the Dream Journal.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr />

    <!-- FAQ SECTION -->
    <section class="faqs">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <details>
        <summary>How do you navigate the site and the Dream Symbols page?</summary>
        <p>
          The site is organized into symbolic chambers. The Dream Symbols page is your reference library —  
          browse categories like Animals, Archetypes, Emotions, and Places, or search for a specific symbol.  
          Each symbol page offers a clear interpretation to help you understand what your dreams are communicating.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <details>
        <summary>What is the Guides page for?</summary>
        <p>
          Guides are long‑form articles that explore dream meaning, symbolism, sleep science, and the inner life.  
          They function like blog posts — timeless, reflective pieces designed to deepen your understanding  
          of dreams and the symbolic world.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <details>
        <summary>What is The Seer?</summary>
        <p>
          The Seer is your symbolic companion — a reflective tool that helps you explore meaning in dreams,  
          relationships, and life events. Ask The Seer about a dream, a symbol, or a situation, and it will  
          offer insight drawn from archetypes, patterns, and emotional symbolism.
        </p>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <details>
        <summary>How does the Dream Journal work?</summary>
        <p>
          The Dream Journal lets you record dreams directly in your browser — no login required.  
          Entries are saved locally on your device, creating a private archive of your dream life.  
          Soon, DreamMeaningGuide will offer pattern analysis across weeks and months, helping you  
          discover recurring symbols, emotional themes, and long‑term dream cycles.
        </p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <hr />

    <!-- QUICK LINKS -->
    <section class="quick-links">
      <h2>Explore the Site</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/dream-symbols">Dream Symbols Dictionary</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides">Guides & Articles</a></li>
        <li><a href="/seer">Consult The Seer</a></li>
        <li><a href="/journal">Dream Journal</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sleep-tools">Sleep Tools Hub</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .tagline {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #cbb7ff;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #e8d9ff;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .faqs h2 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    details {
      background: #1a0030;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
